# paper's exact pins, from experiments/paper/rerankers/reference/requirements.txt (the former
# [local] extra of the package). Install with the reference python:
# pip install -r reference.lock
#
# torch 2.9.1 is the only torch with an official Dao-AILab flash-attn 2.8.3 prebuilt wheel for
# cp312 + cu12; transformers 4.57.6 is the paper-era release. flash-attn needs torch already
# installed and a CUDA toolchain; it ships prebuilt wheels on Linux x86_64 for this pin.
# `render` mode is pure string work (no tokenizer, no torch import), so stage 1 of
# the equivalence check runs on CPU without the weights.
